# Descent witnesses for the literal common factors

Each row records a normal-form index, a smaller predecessor, and a generator.
The candidate equation is word(index) = word(generator) * word(predecessor).
The witnesses are generated from the original seeds.json and actual packed
permutations; their checks and soundness are in FactorMembership.lean.
Source: Parrott (1972), §5, p.683; the original JSON files are preserved.
-/

